{"message":"The Green Fee-Free Account does not meet your early-pay requirement. Its documented early direct deposit is 0 days before payday, so paychecks generally arrive on the official pay date. I will not open that account for you.

For a Gold Plus Account, the documented credit-card APY bonuses are: Gold Rewards Card +0.35% (highest), Crypto-Cash Back Card +0.30%, Platinum Rewards Card +0.20%, Bronze Rewards Card +0.15%, and others at +0.10% or less. Credit-card bonuses do not stack; only the highest applicable bonus is used. With exactly $25,000, you would meet the Gold Plus minimum balance, but there would be no cushion if the balance ever fell below $25,000, which could trigger the account’s monthly fee.

I could not find documentation confirming travel-insurance coverage for any of those cards. Because travel insurance is essential for you, I cannot represent any card as meeting that requirement or recommend opening one on that basis. Also, since Green Fee-Free does not provide early direct deposit, I have not opened or closed anything. A documented alternative is Green Account, which provides direct deposit up to 1 day early, but it has different fees and a different savings pairing. If you want, I can review that alternative next."}
